silm:instances_papers_01_orientation_chapters_15_witness_traceability_sections_03_ledger_row_anatomy_concrete_anchor_1#cannon_cat_joy_of_cats_md silm:hasLongDescription "The cannon/cat/joy_of_cats.md is cannon/cat/joy_of_cats.md is the witness_path value in the joc620 ledger row. It is the leftmost source node in the ledger row anatomy diagram. Together with witness_line_range (2340-2360) and verbatim_quote, it constitutes the three-field traceability core that the locate+extract phase must produce." .
